## Design-system packs

A pack reads a design system's published tokens and maps them onto Polyxd's
semantic token contract. The upstream token files are vendored verbatim — so a
pack can be regenerated and audited without a network — under that pack's
`scripts/sources/` directory, together with the upstream licence.

The packs are Polyxd's work, not the work of the design systems they read. The
names below identify whose tokens a pack reads. Polyxd is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any of these projects or their owners, and each
name is the trademark of its owner.

